Hey Larkspur team,

I've got a bit of a project coming up and I'm really excited about it - I'm g=
oing to be hiring the 1954 Wexcombe Regent for a film shoot. We're still tryi=
ng to pin down the exact dates, but we're thinking sometime in September 2027=
. The car will need to be brought to Hotel Miramar Norvalle, which is where w=
e'll be setting up shop, and then I imagine it'll be easier to take it back f=
rom there afterwards.

I've attached my driving licence as proof of ID, just in case that's necessar=
y.

Best wishes,
Silas Holloway-Pike

